    "en": "Since April 2022, 22 of the 22 vetoed proposals have been debated in the General Assembly. The vetoing country took the floor in 15 of the 15 veto initiative debates."
   },
   "kaynak": {
    "tr": "A/RES/76/262 · A/…/PV kayıtları ve BM Günlüğü · 17 Eylül 2026",
    "en": "A/RES/76/262 · A/…/PV records and UN Journal · 17 September 2026"
